 "shownotes": [
  "Bustout night: Big Ball Jam returned for the first time since 12/9/94 — beach balls in the crowd, a hoop onstage — and La Grange made only its second appearance since 1999. Also back from the vault: Sparks, Sweet Adeline, Kung over the Makisupa groove, and Makisupa itself with an \"iced green matcha tea\" keyword winking at '93.",
  "Community pulse — \"the electricity at set break could have powered Kuroda's rig.\""
 ],
